gives.text:
Name, OS, owner, online, who is using it, days left, then "You can:" with each capability and its commands, then
"Missing:" with each unavailable capability and why. 1.1 adds:
- "Awake: yes", "Awake: no (screen off since 10:02)" (the time for owners only), or "Awake: — (offline; last seen asleep)";
- "Waking: Extend can't tell when this iPhone wakes" when it can't (iPhone, iPad, apps older than 1.1);
- owners: "Also paired by another Carbon" when so; access grouped by Team; "Wake requests: on|off"; each open
  wake request (Silicon, Team, reason, expiry, whether the device showed it, the Ting's delivery); on a computer
  several Carbons paired, the shared-computer note (only the installer's Silicons get the terminal there);
- a carried device refused as a duplicate, or waiting to be recognised: its setup step;
- Silicons: their own open wake request, and "Same device as 3a2b0c1d" when another Carbon's pair of it is theirs too.
